      "single-profile: 540x16 + 1003 + fujiwara/dnam ups = 12735\n",
      "pairwise: 7960 | drugs 10000 | knowledge 8000\n",
      "FINAL MIXTURE: 38695 (single 33%, pair 21%, drugs 26%, know 21%)\n",
